## Interface: 16001
## Title: TwizBuff
## Notes: Shows which friendly players (you, your party or raid, and your friendly target) are missing the buffs your class can give - Mark of the Wild, Power Word: Fortitude, Arcane Intellect, Blessings and more - and casts the next one with one click, key or mouse-wheel notch.
